      "lines": [
        "图164"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "而超导体没有热效应(参阅§92)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "86. 电流强度"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果电路中有电流，则这就是说，电荷经常不断地通过导",
        "体的横截面. 单位时间内通过的电量，作为电流的定量的表",
        "示，叫做电流强度. 如果在$\\Delta t$时间内通过导体横截面的电量",
        "为$q$，则电流强度为"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$I=\\frac{q}{\\Delta t}.$　(9-1)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由此可见，**电流强度等于在$\\Delta t$时间间隔内通过导体横截面",
        "的电量跟该时间间隔的比值.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果电流强度不随时间改变，则电流叫做稳恒电流."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "电流强度，跟电量一样，是一个标量. 它可以为正，也可"
      ]
    },
